# Build artefacts.
#
# `out/bundles/` and `out/terrain/` are deliberately NOT ignored: the backend
# loads the bundles as seed fixtures at milestone 3 (Part 21.1), and the terrain
# extracts are what `course_bundles.terrain_pmtiles_key` points at. They have to
# be committable for a checkout to be able to seed.
#
# Note on the terrain extracts: they are ~20 MB for three courses and grow with
# every course added. Part 10.3 puts them in object storage behind a CDN, which
# is where they belong long term -- committing them is a launch convenience, not
# the destination. Everything under out/ is reproducible from specs/ with
# `course-ingest regenerate-all`.
out/*
!out/bundles/
!out/terrain/

# Review images and the review page: regenerable, and not codebase content.
out/visual-check/

.cache/
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
